{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（16日）傍晚6時23分，警方接獲一名泳客報案指，發現一名74歲彭姓女子於屯門黃金泳灘近岸邊位置昏迷，懷疑遇溺，報案泳客及救生員遂將她救起。</p><p>救護員到場，女事主仍然不省人事，立即將其送往屯門醫院進行搶救，其後證實死亡，死者死因有待驗屍後確定，警方現正追查事發原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"女子被送往屯門醫院救治，惜最終證實不治。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1156907447559000064023786.jpeg/1ZTNEGnLq4o6mEzeCtau1FdDW8HXbwNcjo5Gd7SORnc\"/><figcaption>女子被送往屯門醫院救治，惜最終證實不治。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T16:39:16.766822+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:04:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T00:35:11.848166+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T16:37:43.919975+00:00","content_hash":"3706eca2f323883fa1be2e0647fe17b1cea6c0daf875e5ce51a00bb9a5e1b220","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}